# Relations this migration declares; probed by db-schema/tests/schema_fence.rs.
#
# The two CHECK constraints are not declared here, because a constraint is an
# implementation detail of the table rather than a relation a consumer binds
# to. Note the grammar does cover more than tables and views — `column`,
# `rows` and `none` are accepted too — so this is a choice, not a limit.
table maker_ladder_epoch
